WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
 Data centers are coming to Texas.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.840
 Oh shit, we don't want to go there.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:12.840
 No shooting in this area.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.200
 Does that include this?

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.300
 Shooting?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.540
 Ha, whatever.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:21.980
 We don't want to go there, but we have to.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.680
 They're coming.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.320
 They're coming, aren't they?

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.620
 And if the data centers are coming,

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.820
 the AI is here, and it's not going away.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.860
 What are you going to do about it?

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.580
 I've had a long time to think about that.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.420
 I'll tell you what I'm going to do about it.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.420
 I'll tell you.

